Δw = fit(I_base · C) − fit(I_base), added to the 1D weights (I_corrected ≈ I_1D − Σ Δw_j T_j). Magnetic: C = I_B/I_hydro (MURaM, same code with and without field), I_base = MPS-ATLAS Set 2 band profile at the nearest grid point. MURaM 3D: C = I_hydro/I_MPS2 (MPS-ATLAS Set 2 = the code that synthesised the MURaM spectra; nearest grid point within 150 K). Stagger 3D: Δw = fit(Stagger) − fit(ATLAS9/Kurucz) at identical (Teff, log g, [M/H]) from the ExoTiC-LD bundle. MURaM ratios held constant below μ = 0.1.

